{"4270780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rally Shift", "steam_appid": 4270780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally Shift</strong> is a first person stealth rallying racing game. Where you are tasked to control a rally car that is having a bomb, that you need to escort to safety as fast as possible. Use any driving techniques necessary to reach the end FAST. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270780/extras/5d292d43334908508883beb91d0bf185.poster.avif?t=1783435134\" aria-label=\"Rallying Up a Hill Throuhh a Curve\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270780/extras/5d292d43334908508883beb91d0bf185.webm?t=1783435134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270780/extras/5d292d43334908508883beb91d0bf185.mp4?t=1783435134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get to control two different modes of the car, those being electric and engine mode.  Both have different driving properties when it comes to speed, suspension, steering and noise. Each car mode has their own strengths and weaknesses that can be used depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270780/extras/bc85cd220f52b3b6d6f4e145eba1ab0d.poster.avif?t=1783435134\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270780/extras/bc85cd220f52b3b6d6f4e145eba1ab0d.webm?t=1783435134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270780/extras/bc85cd220f52b3b6d6f4e145eba1ab0d.mp4?t=1783435134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally across various gloomy biomes spanning 12+ levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift between engine and electric both having different driving styles and tools to use </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level &amp; stage completion ranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in the leaderboards to get the best time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally Shift</strong> is a first person stealth rallying racing game. Where you are tasked to control a rally car that is having a bomb, that you need to escort to safety as fast as possible. Use any driving techniques necessary to reach the end FAST. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270780/extras/5d292d43334908508883beb91d0bf185.poster.avif?t=1783435134\" aria-label=\"Rallying Up a Hill Throuhh a Curve\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270780/extras/5d292d43334908508883beb91d0bf185.webm?t=1783435134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270780/extras/5d292d43334908508883beb91d0bf185.mp4?t=1783435134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get to control two different modes of the car, those being electric and engine mode.  Both have different driving properties when it comes to speed, suspension, steering and noise. Each ca